        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurong_West"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Boon Lay Bus Interchange opened in July 1990, the same month Boon Lay MRT station began service.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurong_West"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Originally a forested area, the Housing and Development Board rapidly transformed Jurong West into a fully mature housing estate.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurong_West"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Jurong Central Park, a rectangular green space behind Boon Lay MRT, sits in the Kian Teck subzone.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurong_West"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Jurong West Community Building integrates the public library, a community club, and a medical centre under one roof.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jurong_West"
    },
    {
